  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Signing Safe Futures South Africa!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deaf children in South Africa are particularly susceptible to abuse of all kinds; unable to communicate with the outside world, they cannot speak up against the ill-treatment they are suffering. The project aims to empower deaf children so that they can stand up for themselves. At the same time, it will build the knowledge and capacities of organisations who offer helplines and support to children facing abuse so that they can extend their services to deaf children. The result will be that deaf children are more aware of abuse, better able to report what is happening to them, and better able to receive help.</narrative>
  </description>
